beav|beav/BEAV140|basic.c ebcdic.c fileio.c region.c text.c wangpc.c buffer.c echo.c language.c main.c search.c tty.c window.c cinfo.c extend.c kbd.c spawn.c ttyio.c termio_osk.c tcap.c word.c display.c file.c line.c random.c symbol.c ttykbd.c format.c osk.c|NOPROTO|/dd/LIB/termlib.l|
# A LIBRARY, not a program: a first field ending in `.l' makes rebuild.sh
# compile each source and merge the objects, with nothing to link.  This is
# SRC/unixlib built the way its own makefile builds it, and it is what somebody
# would drop into their own LIB rather than name file-by-file in every recipe
# that wants getopt or vsprintf.
unix.l|unixlib|alarm.c stat.c _secsince70.c ioctl.c ttyname.c isatty.c signal.c execl.c perror.c bcmp.c rand.c strchr.c strrchr.c strpbrk.c strtok.c strspn.c strcspn.c getopt.c vsprintf.c ctype.c bcopy.c execv.c|STATIC||

